  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></math> matrix and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>det</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>. If  <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mfenced><munder><munder><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mo>.</mo><mo>...</mo><mfenced><mfenced open=\"\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mn>2024</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>times</mi></mrow></munder></mfenced></math>, then the remainder when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math> is divided by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>9</mn></math> is equal to __________.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>det</mi><mfenced><munder><munder><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mn>2024</mn><mo> </mo><mi>times</mi></mrow></munder></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, using the formula <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>⏟</mo></munder><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo> </mo><mi>times</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>r</mi></msup></msup></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><munder><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>..</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mo>⏟</mo></munder></mfenced><mrow><mn>2024</mn><mo> </mo><mi>times</mi></mrow></munder><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now, solving</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>1012</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>1012</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>·</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>·</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>k</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2024</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the remainder is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math></p>",
